iv>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Fortress\">Old Fortress</a> (north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Masonry\">Old Masonry</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Forbidden%20Temple%20%28Carlin%29\">Forbidden Temple (Carlin)</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights in close combat.<br/><br/>A vicious squire attacks in melee range. A vicious squire never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUsually found in groups alongside <a href=\"#/wiki/Renegade%20Knight\">Renegade Knights</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vile%20Grandmaster\">Vile Grandmasters</a>, so area spells like <a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> might be a good idea in order to finish them off quickly so one can focus on the stronger creatures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 39,624 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a